with a teleport-away monster, I'm not going to kill it while I'm getting
to the upstairs (whether I have a +2 MB, a +7 MB, or a crunch weapon) so I
might as well take the best chance of cancelling it. That fits with the
idea of MB for walking around and a crunch weapon for actually killing
things.
